[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n  I've built your iOS-ready electronics parts tracker app (\u001b[1mPartsBench\u001b[m) using a layered MVVM + Repository architecture\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  with Material 3 light/dark support and local JSON/CSV persistence.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### What Was Built\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mDomain Models\u001b[m\n\u001b[12D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk46a70899a9cbd7a5;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/electronic_part.dart#L4-L185\u0007ElectronicPart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Tracks part name, category, package/footprint (\u001b[94m0805\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSOT-23\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDIP-8\u001b[m, etc.), value/specs, stock\r\n\u001b[6Cquantity, low-stock threshold, storage location, supplier name, supplier SKU, MPN, unit price, datasheet URL,\r\n\u001b[6Cand workbench notes.\n\u001b[20D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk71b0963259d6ea3d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/part_category.dart#L4-L98\u0007PartCategory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Color-coded categories with icons (Resistors, Capacitors, Inductors, ICs & MCUs, Semiconductors,\r\n\u001b[6CLEDs & Di"]
[0.0, "o", "splays, Sensors, Connectors, Power & Modules, Switches & Relays, Other).\n\u001b[81D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9cd85547d1ba4ca7;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/storage_location_summary.dart#L4-L28\u0007StorageLocationSummary\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Aggregates part counts, total units, low-stock alerts, and value per storage\r\n\u001b[6Cbin/drawer/book.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mData & Persistence Layer\u001b[m\n\u001b[23D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9eff1112f4a67c37;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L16-L78\u0007FileLocalStorageService\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007: Persists your inventory locally to the iOS \u001b[94mDocuments\u001b[m directory\n\u001b[89D(\u001b[94melectronics_parts_inventory_v1.json\u001b[m), pre-seeded on first launch via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6ab8842b5ed72d43;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/sample_parts_data.dart#L5-L157\u0007SamplePartsData\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\n\u001b[86D• \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk23e17a6b239b887;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flut"]
