[0.0, "o", "view-model, and widget tests fast and\r\n  deterministic without external mocking libraries.\u001b[K\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### 2. High-Priority Bugs & Risks\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m#### A. Fragile File Storage & Data Loss Risk on Load Failure\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mLocation\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2eb162e7b01e2858;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L22-L42\u0007FileLocalStorageService._resolveStorageFile\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb7a52f9ef8488148;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L21-L34\u0007PartsRepository.getParts\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[80D\u001b[1mIssues\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      1. \u001b[1mCross-platform path resolution\u001b[m: \u001b[94m_resolveStorageFile()\u001b[m checks \u001b[94mPlatform.environment['HOME']\u001b[m and appends\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/Documents\u001b[m. On \u001b[1mAndroid\u001b[m (where \u001b[94mHOME\u001b[m is unset) and \u001b[1mWindows\u001b[m (which uses \u001b[94mUSERPROFILE\u001b[m), this falls back to\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mDirectory.systemTemp\u001b[m, which th"]
