[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 30s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Here is a review of the \u001b[1mPartsBench (\u001b[94;22mparts_tracker_baseline\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m codebase.\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### 1. Overview & Strengths\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mClean Layered Architecture\u001b[m: Clear separation between \u001b[94mdomain\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk302ec655663c413d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/electronic_part.dart#L4-L227\u0007ElectronicPart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfe9a842800f98597;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/part_category.dart#L4-L97\u0007PartCategory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007,\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6ac6f810a523855;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/storage_location_summary.dart#L4-L29\u0007StorageLocationSummary\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), \u001b[94mdata\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke49e3bce22689dfd;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L7-L167\u0007Pa"]
