[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 30s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Here is a review of the \u001b[1mPartsBench (\u001b[94;22mparts_tracker_baseline\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m codebase.\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### 1. Overview & Strengths\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mClean Layered Architecture\u001b[m: Clear separation between \u001b[94mdomain\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc562d270dd19ba4b;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/electronic_part.dart#L4-L227\u0007ElectronicPart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6deb353cdece1d69;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/part_category.dart#L4-L97\u0007PartCategory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007,\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc7426a154db2becb;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/storage_location_summary.dart#L4-L29\u0007StorageLocationSummary\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), \u001b[94mdata\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaf690ef1203e99d3;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L7-L167\u0007P"]
[0.0, "o", "artsRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk740354f853777e91;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L5-L12\u0007LocalStorageService\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk188095223711ff96;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/import_export_service.dart#L8-L241\u0007ImportExportService\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), and \u001b[94mui\u001b[m\r\n  (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7f39b34c9a8d7265;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/view_models/inventory_view_model.dart#L32-L373\u0007InventoryViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and views).\u001b[K\n\u001b[29D\u001b[1mZero Analyzer Warnings & Passing Tests\u001b[m: \u001b[94mflutter analyze\u001b[m reports 0 issues and all unit/widget tests pass.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mDependency-Free Testability\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk11aa2fd760a4565a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L85-L104\u0007InMemoryLocalStorageService\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 makes re"]
[0.0, "o", "pository, view-model, and widget tests fast and\r\n  deterministic without external mocking libraries.\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### 2. High-Priority Bugs & Risks\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m#### A. Fragile File Storage & Data Loss Risk on Load Failure\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[4C\u001b[1mLocation\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkee8f7d02c0362f35;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L22-L42\u0007FileLocalStorageService._resolveStorageFile\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk28c93879d461536d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L21-L34\u0007PartsRepository.getParts\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  • \u001b[1mIssues\u001b[m:\u001b[K\n\u001b[5D1. \u001b[1mCross-platform path resolution\u001b[m: \u001b[94m_resolveStorageFile()\u001b[m checks \u001b[94mPlatform.environment['HOME']\u001b[m and appends\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/Documents\u001b[m. On \u001b[1mAndroid\u001b[m (where \u001b[94mHOME\u001b[m is unset) and \u001b[1mWindows\u001b[m (which uses \u001b[94mUSERPROFILE\u001b[m), this falls back to\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mDirectory.systemTemp\u001b[m, whic"]
[0.0, "o", "h the OS can purge at any time. On \u001b[1mWeb\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdart:io\u001b[m throws \u001b[94mUnsupportedError\u001b[m. Consider\r\n\u001b[6Cusing \u001b[94mpath_provider\u001b[m (\u001b[94mgetApplicationDocumentsDirectory()\u001b[m).\u001b[K\n\u001b[57D2. \u001b[1mDestructive fallback on parse errors\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk911006445d3ed2b0;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L45-L69\u0007FileLocalStorageService.loadPartsJson\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 catches all exceptions and\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Creturns \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m if the file is malformed. \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkffeb6849b43e8fa1;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L27-L34\u0007PartsRepository.getParts\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 tr\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[70D\u001b[?2026l"]
