[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 30s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Here is a review of the \u001b[1mPartsBench (\u001b[94;22mparts_tracker_baseline\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m codebase.\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### 1. Overview & Strengths\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mClean Layered Architecture\u001b[m: Clear separation between \u001b[94mdomain\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk147ce4217d259137;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/electronic_part.dart#L4-L227\u0007ElectronicPart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk98d98daa3bd2c6d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/part_category.dart#L4-L97\u0007PartCategory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007,\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk201121ea027b0b0f;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/storage_location_summary.dart#L4-L29\u0007StorageLocationSummary\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), \u001b[94mdata\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk89e4cae4e4dacc57;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L7-L167\u0007PartsRepo"]
[0.0, "o", "sitory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk20b7f4fbc30bb695;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L5-L12\u0007LocalStorageService\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc10787e74e0a11ca;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/import_export_service.dart#L8-L241\u0007ImportExportService\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), and \u001b[94mui\u001b[m\r\n  (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4b518abb21edcd01;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/view_models/inventory_view_model.dart#L32-L373\u0007InventoryViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and views).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mZero Analyzer Warnings & Passing Tests\u001b[m: \u001b[94mflutter analyze\u001b[m reports 0 issues and all unit/widget tests pass.\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[1mDependency-Free Testability\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk33e134ab1e2fcc0e;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L85-L104\u0007InMemoryLocalStorageService\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 makes repository, v"]
[0.0, "o", "iew-model, and widget tests fast and\r\n  deterministic without external mocking libraries.\u001b[K\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### 2. High-Priority Bugs & Risks\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m#### A. Fragile File Storage & Data Loss Risk on Load Failure\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mLocation\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcf3227085f2324d9;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L22-L42\u0007FileLocalStorageService._resolveStorageFile\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6c0277f7be238d31;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L21-L34\u0007PartsRepository.getParts\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[80D\u001b[1mIssues\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      1. \u001b[1mCross-platform path resolution\u001b[m: \u001b[94m_resolveStorageFile()\u001b[m checks \u001b[94mPlatform.environment['HOME']\u001b[m and appends\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/Documents\u001b[m. On \u001b[1mAndroid\u001b[m (where \u001b[94mHOME\u001b[m is unset) and \u001b[1mWindows\u001b[m (which uses \u001b[94mUSERPROFILE\u001b[m), this falls back to\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mDirectory.systemTemp\u001b[m, which the"]
[0.0, "o", " OS can purge at any time. On \u001b[1mWeb\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdart:io\u001b[m throws \u001b[94mUnsupportedError\u001b[m. Consider\r\n\u001b[6Cusing \u001b[94mpath_provider\u001b[m (\u001b[94mgetApplicationDocumentsDirectory()\u001b[m).\u001b[K\n\u001b[57D2. \u001b[1mDestructive fallback on parse errors\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf2775638a23fe08c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L45-L69\u0007FileLocalStorageService.loadPartsJson\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 catches all exceptions and\r\n\u001b[6Creturns \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m if the file is malformed. \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7e617333e1fbbcdd;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L27-L34\u0007PartsRepository.getParts\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 treats \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m as \"first run\" and immediately\r\n\u001b[6Ccalls \u001b[94m_persist\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[18D\u001b[?2026l"]
