[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A• \u001b[1mClean Layered Architecture\u001b[m: Clear separation between \u001b[94mdomain\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3ea0b32d47eecb6;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/electronic_part.dart#L4-L227\u0007ElectronicPart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcb2eda2efd10ba4a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/part_category.dart#L4-L97\u0007PartCategory\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007,\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka91330f12c9957fa;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/storage_location_summary.dart#L4-L29\u0007StorageLocationSummary\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), \u001b[94mdata\u001b[m (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8c7b898088549c1c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L7-L167\u0007PartsRepository\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb1cc21d4ac43856a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L5-L12\u0007LocalStorageService\u001b[m"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkeaa17bead5d2f83f;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/import_export_service.dart#L8-L241\u0007ImportExportService\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007), and \u001b[94mui\u001b[m\r\n  (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkea82a92cc61cbe50;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/view_models/inventory_view_model.dart#L32-L373\u0007InventoryViewModel\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and views).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mZero Analyzer Warnings & Passing Tests\u001b[m: \u001b[94mflutter analyze\u001b[m reports 0 issues and all unit/widget tests pass.\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[1mDependency-Free Testability\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkefdf1d85e54c3215;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L85-L104\u0007InMemoryLocalStorageService\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 makes repository, view-model, and widget tests fast and\r\n  deterministic without external mocking libraries.\u001b[K\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### 2. High-Priority Bugs & Risks\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m#### A. Fragile File Stor"]
[0.0, "o", "age & Data Loss Risk on Load Failure\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mLocation\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7494ca9ade63312c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L22-L42\u0007FileLocalStorageService._resolveStorageFile\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkeae62e03b676812c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L21-L34\u0007PartsRepository.getParts\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[80D\u001b[1mIssues\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      1. \u001b[1mCross-platform path resolution\u001b[m: \u001b[94m_resolveStorageFile()\u001b[m checks \u001b[94mPlatform.environment['HOME']\u001b[m and appends\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/Documents\u001b[m. On \u001b[1mAndroid\u001b[m (where \u001b[94mHOME\u001b[m is unset) and \u001b[1mWindows\u001b[m (which uses \u001b[94mUSERPROFILE\u001b[m), this falls back to\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mDirectory.systemTemp\u001b[m, which the OS can purge at any time. On \u001b[1mWeb\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdart:io\u001b[m throws \u001b[94mUnsupportedError\u001b[m. Consider\r\n\u001b[6Cusing \u001b[94mpath_provider\u001b[m (\u001b[94mgetApplicationDocumentsDirectory()\u001b[m).\u001b[K\n\u001b[57D2. \u001b[1mDest"]
[0.0, "o", "ructive fallback on parse errors\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk214f19d1ed680383;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L45-L69\u0007FileLocalStorageService.loadPartsJson\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 catches all exceptions and\r\n\u001b[6Creturns \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m if the file is malformed. \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk38f524e7694556cc;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L27-L34\u0007PartsRepository.getParts\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 treats \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m as \"first run\" and immediately\r\n\u001b[6Ccalls \u001b[94m_persist()\u001b[m with sample data, \u001b[1moverwriting the user's file\u001b[m rather than surfacing a read error or backing up\r\n\u001b[6Cthe corrupt file.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n  \u001b[1m#### B. Sub-Cent Unit Price Precision Loss on Edit & CSV Export\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mLocation\u001b[m: [\u001b[94mPartFormSheet.initState\u001b[m](file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-\r\n  experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/featur\u001b[K\n\n\n\u001b[47D\u001b[?2026l"]
