[0.0, "o", "4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4my\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4m.\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mg\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4me\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mP\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ms\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  • \u001b[1mIssues\u001b[m:\n\u001b[5D1. \u001b[1mCross-platform path resolution\u001b[m: \u001b[94m_resolveStorageFile()\u001b[m checks \u001b[94mPlatform.environment['HOME']\u001b[m and appends\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m/Documents\u001b[m. On \u001b[1mAndroid\u001b[m (where \u001b[94mHOME\u001b[m is unset) and \u001b[1mWindows\u001b[m (which uses \u001b[94mUSERPROFILE\u001b[m), this falls back to\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mDirectory.systemTemp\u001b[m, which the OS can purge at any time. On \u001b[1mWeb\u001b[m, \u001b[94mdart:io\u001b[m throws \u001b[94mUnsupportedError\u001b[m. Consider\r\n\u001b[6Cusing \u001b[94mpath_provider\u001b[m (\u001b[94mgetApplicationDocumentsDirectory()\u001b[m).\n\u001b[57D2. \u001b[1mDestructive fallback on parse errors\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf873edf9ed1a4722;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L45-L69\u0007FileLocalStorageService.loadPartsJson\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 catches all excep"]
[0.0, "o", "tions and\r\n\u001b[6Creturns \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m if the file is malformed. \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk70c31bb4e42c28df;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L27-L34\u0007PartsRepository.getParts\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 treats \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m as \"first run\" and immediately\r\n\u001b[6Ccalls \u001b[94m_persist()\u001b[m with sample data, \u001b[1moverwriting the user's file\u001b[m rather than surfacing a read error or backing up\r\n\u001b[6Cthe corrupt file.\r\n\n\n  \u001b[1m#### B. Sub-Cent Unit Price Precision Loss on Edit & CSV Export\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mLocation\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1772f760c4fde55;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/views/part_form_sheet.dart#L89-L93\u0007PartFormSheet.initState\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbc907c3fb8d9d3f6;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/import_export_service.dart#L90\u0007ImportExportService.exportToCsv\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  • \u001b[1mIssue\u001b[m: Passive components (resistors, MLCCs) ofte"]
[0.0, "o", "n have sub-cent unit prices in bulk (e.g., \u001b[94m$0.0045\u001b[m). Formatting\r\n  with \u001b[94munitPrice.toStringAsFixed(2)\u001b[m truncates \u001b[94m$0.0045\u001b[m to \u001b[94m\"0.00\"\u001b[m when opening the edit form or exporting to CSV.\r\n\n  \u001b[1m#### C. Concurrent File Writes on Rapid Stock Adjustments\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mLocation\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkdd24d27ae78e9c9e;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L162-L166\u0007PartsRepository._persist\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 & \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd26686cc187a5d47;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L72-L81\u0007FileLocalStorageService.savePartsJson\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  • \u001b[1mIssue\u001b[m: Rapidly tapping the \u001b[94m+\u001b[m / \u001b[94m-\u001b[m buttons on \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5cefdf819f10c6f4;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/views/parts_list_view.dart#L260-L263\u0007PartsListView\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 or \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka7192a1d4ef3dcfb;file:///Users/"]
