[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 5m 15s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Expanded the unit and widget tests to cover the corrected behaviors. Added tests for `formatt...)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 16 files \u001b[37m(part_category.dart, electronic_part.dart, app_theme.dart, +13)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(flutter analyze && flutter test)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  All identified issues have been resolved and verified with \u001b[94mflutter analyze\u001b[m and \u001b[94mflutter test\u001b[m:\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Summary of Fixes\u001b[m\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mStorage Safety & Serialized File Writes\u001b[m\n\u001b[38D• \u001b[1mPrevented destructive overwrite on corrupt files\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk129dcb97dd26b36e;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L46-L78\u0007FileLocalStorageService.loadPartsJson\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 now throws a\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3f29ab7573287fd7;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart"]
[0.0, "o", "#L60-L63\u0007FormatException\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 when the storage file contains malformed JSON instead of returning \u001b[94mnull\u001b[m, preventing\n\u001b[99D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaff34853c146b3f1;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L25-L38\u0007PartsRepository.getParts\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 from overwriting user data with sample parts.\n\u001b[70D• \u001b[1mCross-platform path fallback\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf5f9d916d6b0c155;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/local_storage_service.dart#L22-L43\u0007FileLocalStorageService._resolveStorageFile\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 now checks both \u001b[94mHOME\u001b[m and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mUSERPROFILE\u001b[m (for Windows).\n\u001b[26D• \u001b[1mSerialized async writes\u001b[m: \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka9ce08654150afdd;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/repositories/parts_repository.dart#L176-L185\u0007PartsRepository._persist\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 queues persistence operations on \u001b[94m_writeChain\u001b[m so rapid\r\n\u001b[6Cquantity adjustment"]
[0.0, "o", "s do not cause overlapping file I/O.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mSub-Cent Unit Price Precision\u001b[m\n\u001b[28D• Added \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb2fc0d8255ae3bdc;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/domain/models/electronic_part.dart#L53-L65\u0007ElectronicPart.formattedUnitPrice\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to format prices with at least 2 decimal places while preserving up\r\n\u001b[6Cto 6 decimal places for sub-cent components (e.g., \u001b[94m$0.0045\u001b[m).\n\u001b[60D• Updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke1988794266cbc6a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/data/services/import_export_service.dart#L90\u0007ImportExportService.exportToCsv\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc3a81349cc544ab4;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/views/part_form_sheet.dart#L90-L92\u0007PartFormSheet\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, and \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk78bdd8d1441bb29c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_baseline/lib/ui/features/inventory/views/part_detail_screen.dart#L438-L440\u0007PartDe"]
